By default, enum values start from 0.

```cpp
enum Side {
    Buy,  // 0
    Sell  // 1
};
```

You can also assign explicit values:

```cpp
enum OrderStatus {
    New = 1,
    Filled = 2,
    Cancelled = 3,
    Rejected = 4
};
```

