sections.bodyMarkdown:
Basic lambda syntax:

```cpp
[]() {
    // body
};
```

Lambda with parameters:

```cpp
[](int x) {
    return x > 0;
};
```

Store a lambda in a variable:

```cpp
auto isPositive = [](int x) {
    return x > 0;
};
```

Call it:

```cpp
isPositive(10);
```

Lambda used directly in an algorithm:

```cpp
std::sort(v.begin(), v.end(), [](int a, int b) {
    return a < b;
});
```

