Capture by value allows the lambda to copy outside variables into itself.

```cpp
int threshold = 1000;

auto isLarge = [threshold](int quantity) {
    return quantity > threshold;
};
```

Main idea:

```text
Capture by value gives the lambda its own copy of outside variables.
```

